esbach! This handsome brick townhouse at #7, 1015 Gault Boulevard NW spans three levels above grade plus a basement, offering 3 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, dormer windows and a fenced front yard.  The open-concept main floor pairs a bright living room with a dining area anchored by a tiled fireplace. The kitchen shows off solid wood cabinetry, a centre island, stainless steel appliances, a stone-tile backsplash and pendant lighting over walnut hardwood floors. A handy 2-pc bath completes this level.  On the second level you'll find a spacious family room, a second bedroom, laundry and a 4-pc bath. The entire third level is the primary retreat, complete with a 5-pc ensuite and a generous walk-in closet. The basement adds a third bedroom, a 3-pc bath and plenty of storage, and a single detached garage completes the package.  Outside your door, Griesbach's tree-lined streets, walking trails, parks and the community lake give this North Edmonton neighbourhood a welcoming feel. See it for yourself! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$435,000"],["Type","Townhouse"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","4"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,894 sq ft"],["Lot size","1,660 sq ft"],["Year built","2007"],["Storeys","3"],["Condo fee","$230 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Griesbach"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5E5B6"],["MLS® number","E4516302"],["Listed","November 12, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Central Vacuum, Gas stove(s), Dishwasher, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Gas, Corner"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage, Heated Garage"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Family room","Upper Level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level",""],["Bedr